  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "No metal shows between these ruby petals.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook",
        "show": "brooch",
        "shape": "mystery",
        "tone": "#d2223c",
        "color": "#5bb4e8"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Van Cleef and Arpels patented a new setting in 1933.",
      "say": "Van Cleef and Arpels patented a new setting in nineteen thirty-three.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "workshop",
        "name": "Van Cleef & Arpels",
        "role": "A patent, 1933",
        "color": "#ec6a9c",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "apron",
            "outfitColor": "#5bb4e8",
            "hair": "short",
            "hairColor": "#3a2c22",
            "skin": "#efc9a6",
            "expression": "focused",
            "glasses": "loupe"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "They called it the Mystery Set.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Mystery Set",
        "sub": "Serti mystérieux",
        "color": "#f7c23a"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Each stone has a groove cut along its sides,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cut",
        "phase": "blade",
        "place": "A groove in each stone",
        "pieces": [
          {
            "tone": "#d2223c"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#4cc3a8"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "so it can slide onto thin rails of gold.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cut",
        "phase": "result",
        "place": "Rails of gold",
        "color": "#a98be0",
        "pieces": [
          {
            "shape": "princess",
            "size": 0.5,
            "tone": "#d2223c"
          },
          {
            "shape": "princess",
            "size": 0.5,
            "tone": "#d2223c"
          },
          {
            "shape": "princess",
            "size": 0.5,
            "tone": "#d2223c"
          },
          {
            "shape": "princess",
            "size": 0.5,
            "tone": "#d2223c"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "From the front, no metal shows at all.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "jewel",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "mystery": true,
        "shape": "round",
        "tone": "#d2223c",
        "label": "No metal shows",
        "velvet": "#5bb4e8",
        "color": "#f0552e"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "At first, it covered flat objects like compacts.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Compacts",
        "sub": "Its first use",
        "color": "#c8dc3c"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One piece takes about 300 hours,",
      "say": "One piece takes about three hundred hours,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "300 hours",
        "sub": "For one piece",
        "color": "#ec6a9c"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "and each stone can take up to eight hours to prepare.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "workshop",
        "name": "Eight hours",
        "role": "For one stone",
        "color": "#f7c23a",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "apron",
            "outfitColor": "#ec6a9c",
            "hair": "updo",
            "hairColor": "#3a2a1e",
            "skin": "#f3d6bd",
            "expression": "focused",
            "glasses": "loupe",
            "prop": "gem",
            "propTone": "#d2223c"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In 1937, the house made a peony clip of Mystery Set rubies.",
      "say": "In nineteen thirty-seven, the house made a peony clip of Mystery Set rubies.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "gift",
        "stone": "oval",
        "tone": "#d2223c",
        "to": "The peony clip",
        "date": "1937",
        "color": "#5bb4e8"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a lot of patience for one petal.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "jewel",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "mystery": true,
        "shape": "round",
        "tone": "#d2223c",
        "label": "One petal",
        "velvet": "#ec6a9c",
        "color": "#c8dc3c"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Only a few Mystery Set jewels are made each year.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "A few a year",
        "sub": "Mystery Set jewels",
        "color": "#f0552e"
      }
    }
  ],
  "post": {
    "caption": "In 1933 Van Cleef and Arpels patented a setting with no visible metal. Each ruby is cut with a groove and slid onto a gold rail.",
